{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37820","headline":"前寄左省张起居一百言寻蒙唱酬见誉过实却用旧韵重荅 · 郑谷","name":"前寄左省张起居一百言寻蒙唱酬见誉过实却用旧韵重荅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"减瘦经多难，忧伤集晚年。\n吟高风过树，坐久夜凉天。\n旅退慙随衆，孤飞怯向前。\n钓朋蓑叟在，药术衲僧传。\n鬓秃趋荣路，肠焦鄙盗泉。\n品徒诚有隔，推唱意何坚。\n寒地殊知感，秋灯耿不眠。\n从来甘默尔，自此倍怡然。\n兰爲官须握，蒲因学更编。\n预愁摇落後，子美笑无毡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}